#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Privilege separation"
msgstr "Separação de privilégios"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Recent releases of <application>dhcpcd</application> optionally support "
"privilege separation. As the practical security benefits of this are unclear"
" for a program like <application>dhcpcd</application> and the setup is more "
"complicated, the book currently defaults to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Lançamentos recentes do &quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot; "
"suportam opcionalmente a separação de privilégios. Como os benefícios "
"práticos de segurança disso não são claros para um aplicativo como o "
"&quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot; e a configuração é mais "
"complicada, o livro atualmente usa como padrão desativá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you however would like to use privilege separation, additional "
"installation steps are necessary to set up the proper environment. Issue the"
" following commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"No entanto, se você gostaria de usar separação de privilégios, etapas "
"adicionais de instalação são necessárias para configurar o ambiente "
"adequado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install  -v -m700 -d /var/lib/dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"groupadd -g 52 dhcpcd        &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c 'dhcpcd PrivSep' \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/dhcpcd  \\\n"
"         -g dhcpcd           \\\n"
"         -s /bin/false       \\\n"
"         -u 52 dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown    -v dhcpcd:dhcpcd /var/lib/dhcpcd </userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install  -v -m700 -d /var/lib/dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"groupadd -g 52 dhcpcd        &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c 'Separação de privilégios do dhcpcd' \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/dhcpcd  \\\n"
"         -g dhcpcd           \\\n"
"         -s /bin/false       \\\n"
"         -u 52 dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown    -v dhcpcd:dhcpcd /var/lib/dhcpcd </userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of dhcpcd"
msgstr "Instalação do dhcpcd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid "Run a command to allow the code to build without privilege separation:"
msgstr ""
"Execute um comando para permitir que o código construa sem separação de "
"privilégios:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed '384{N;s/\\(.*\\)\\n\\(.*\\)/\\2\\n\\1/}' \\\n"
"  -i src/control.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed '384{N;s/\\(.*\\)\\n\\(.*\\)/\\2\\n\\1/}' \\\n"
"  -i src/control.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <application>dhcpcd</application> without privilege separation by "
"running the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Construa o &quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot; sem separação de "
"privilégios executando o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --disable-privsep         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --disable-privsep         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Alternatively, build <application>dhcpcd</application> with privilege "
"separation by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, construa o <application>dhcpcd</application> com separação"
" de privilégios executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:166
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --privsepuser=dhcpcd         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --privsepuser=dhcpcd         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make test</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:182
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: This switch sets a "
"better location for the dhcpcd internal libraries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: Essa chave configura um"
" local melhor para bibliotecas internas do dhcpcd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:207
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: This switch adjusts the "
"database directory because the default directory, <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/db</filename>, is not FHS-compliant."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: Essa chave ajusta o "
"diretório da base de dados, pois o diretório padrão, <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/db</filename>, não é compatível com o FHS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:213
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--runstatedir=/run</parameter>: This switch sets the runtime "
"state directory because the default <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> is a symbolic link to <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename>, and using <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--runstatedir=/run</parameter>: Essa chave configura o diretório "
"de estado de tempo de execução, pois o padrão <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> é um link simbólico para <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename> e usar <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> está obsoleto."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-privsep</parameter>: This switch disables privilege "
"separation, which is the default in dhcpcd. This switch is not used in the "
"build configuration where privilege separation is used."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-privsep</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a separação "
"de privilégios, que é o padrão no dhcpcd. Essa chave não é usada na "
"configuração da construção onde a separação de privilégios é usada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--privsepuser=dhcpcd</parameter>: This switch sets the privilege "
"separation user in the build configuration where privilege escalation is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--privsepuser=dhcpcd</parameter>: Essa chave configura o(a) "
"usuário(a) de separação de privilégios na configuração da construção onde o "
"escalonamento de privilégios é usado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-hook=...</option>: You can optionally install more hooks, for"
" example to install some configuration files such as "
"<filename>ntp.conf</filename>. A set of hooks can be found in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">dhcpcd-hooks</filename> directory in the build tree."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-hook=...</option>: Opcionalmente, você pode instalar mais "
"ganchos, por exemplo, para instalar alguns arquivos de configuração, como "
"<filename>ntp.conf</filename>. Um conjunto de ganchos pode ser encontrado no"
" diretório <filename class=\"directory\">dhcpcd-hooks</filename> na árvore "
"da construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring dhcpcd"
msgstr "Configurando o dhcpcd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/dhcpcd.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/dhcpcd.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/dhcpcd/dhcpcd.conf"
msgstr "/etc/dhcpcd/dhcpcd.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:258
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:359
#, xml-text
msgid "General Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informações Gerais de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:261
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To configure <command>dhcpcd</command>, you need to first install the "
"network service script, <filename>/usr/lib/services/dhcpcd</filename> "
"included in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package (as the &root; "
"user):"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar o <command>dhcpcd</command>, você precisa primeiro instalar "
"o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de serviço de rede de intercomunicação, "
"<filename>/usr/lib/services/dhcpcd</filename> incluído no pacote <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> (como o(a) usuário(a) &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:269
#, xml-text
msgid "dhcpcd (service script)"
msgstr "dhcpcd (conjunto sequencial de comandos de serviço)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:272
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-service-dhcpcd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-service-dhcpcd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The default for <command>dhcpcd</command> is to set the hostname and mtu. It"
" also overwrites <filename>/etc/resolv.conf </filename> and "
"<filename>/etc/ntp.conf</filename>. These modifications to system files are "
"done by hooks which are stored in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib/dhcpcd/dhcpcd-hooks</filename>.  You can change"
" this behavior by removing or adding hooks from/to that directory. The "
"execution of hooks can be disabled by using the <option>--nohook</option> "
"(<option>-C</option>) command line option or by the <option>nohook</option> "
"option in the <filename>/etc/dhcpcd.conf</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"O padrão para o <command>dhcpcd</command> é o de configurar o nome do "
"dispositivo e o MTU. Ele também sobrescreve <filename>/etc/resolv.conf "
"</filename> e <filename>/etc/ntp.conf</filename>. Essas modificações nos "
"arquivos do sistema são feitas por ganchos que estão armazenados em "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/lib/dhcpcd/dhcpcd-hooks</filename>. Você "
"consegue mudar esse comportamento removendo ou adicionando ganchos de/para "
"esse diretório. A execução de ganchos pode ser desabilitada usando-se a "
"opção de linha de comando <option>--nohook</option> (<option>-C</option>) ou"
" pela opção <option>nohook</option> no arquivo "
"<filename>/etc/dhcpcd.conf</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, as the &root; user, create the "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0</filename> configuration file using "
"the following commands. Adjust appropriately for additional interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, crie o arquivo de configuração "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0</filename> usando os seguintes "
"comandos. Ajuste adequadamente para interfaces adicionais:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:297
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:332
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 (dhcpcd)"
msgstr "/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 (dhcpcd)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:300
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"eth0\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"dhcpcd\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"-b -q -h $HOSTNAME <replaceable>&lt;insert appropriate start options here&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"-k <replaceable>&lt;insert additional stop options here&gt;</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"eth0\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"dhcpcd\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"-b -q -h $HOSTNAME <replaceable>&lt;insira aqui opções apropriadas de início&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"-k <replaceable>&lt;insira opções adicionais de parada aqui&gt;</replaceable>\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:309
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For more information on the appropriate <envar>DHCP_START</envar> and "
"<envar>DHCP_STOP</envar> values, examine the man page for "
"<command>dhcpcd</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para mais informações relativas aos valores apropriados "
"&quot;<envar>DHCP_START</envar>&quot; e "
"&quot;<envar>DHCP_STOP</envar>&quot;, examine a página de manual do "
"&quot;<command>dhcpcd</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:315
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:391
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/resolv.conf"
msgstr "/etc/resolv.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information: fixed ip"
msgstr "Informações de Configuração: IP fixo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:323
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Although not usual, it is possible that you need to configure "
"<application>dhcpcd</application> to use a fixed ip. Here, we give an "
"example. As the &root; user, create the "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0</filename> configuration file using "
"the following commands. Adjust appropriately for additional interfaces and "
"for the actual ip and router you need:"
msgstr ""
"Embora não usual, é possível que você precise configurar o "
"<application>dhcpcd</application> para usar um IP fixo. Aqui, nós fornecemos"
" um exemplo. Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, crie o arquivo de configuração "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0</filename> usando os seguintes "
"comandos. Ajuste adequadamente para interfaces adicionais e para o IP e "
"roteador reais que você precisa:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:335
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"eth0\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"dhcpcd\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"-b -q -S ip_address=192.168.0.10/24 -S routers=192.168.0.1\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"-k\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/ifconfig.eth0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>ONBOOT=\"yes\"\n"
"IFACE=\"eth0\"\n"
"SERVICE=\"dhcpcd\"\n"
"DHCP_START=\"-b -q -S ip_address=192.168.0.10/24 -S routers=192.168.0.1\"\n"
"DHCP_STOP=\"-k\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:344
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can either use DNS servers in <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> from"
" another system, your preferred servers, or just the example "
"<filename>/etc/resolv.conf.head</filename> file below as is:"
msgstr ""
"Você consegue ou usar servidores &quot;DNS&quot; em "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename>&quot; oriundos de outro sistema,"
" teus servidores preferidos, ou apenas o arquivo de exemplo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/resolv.conf.head</filename>&quot; abaixo, como está:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:350
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/resolv.conf.head &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># OpenDNS servers\n"
"nameserver 208.67.222.222\n"
"nameserver 208.67.220.220</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/resolv.conf.head &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Servidores abertos \"DNS\"\n"
"nameserver 208.67.222.222\n"
"nameserver 208.67.220.220</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:362
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to configure network interfaces at boot using "
"<command>dhcpcd</command>, you need to install the systemd unit included in "
"<xref linkend=\"systemd-units\"/> package by running the following command "
"as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser configurar interfaces de rede de intercomunicação na "
"inicialização usando o <command>dhcpcd</command>, você precisa instalar a "
"unidade do systemd incluída no pacote <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\"/> "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:368
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-dhcpcd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-dhcpcd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:376
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The default behavior of <command>dhcpcd</command> is to set the hostname and"
" the mtu. It also overwrites <filename>/etc/resolv.conf </filename> and "
"<filename>/etc/ntp.conf</filename>. These modifications to system "
"configuration files are done by hooks which are stored in <filename "
"class=\"directory\"> /usr/lib/dhcpcd/dhcpcd-hooks</filename>. You can change"
" this behavior by removing or adding hooks from/to that directory. The "
"execution of hooks can be disabled by using the <option>--nohook</option> "
"(<option>-C</option>) command line option or by the <option>nohook</option> "
"option in the <filename>/etc/dhcpcd.conf </filename> file."
msgstr ""
"O comportamento padrão do <command>dhcpcd</command> é o de configurar o nome"
" do dispositivo e o MTU. Ele também sobrescreve "
"<filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> e <filename>/etc/ntp.conf</filename>. "
"Essas modificações nos arquivos de configuração do sistema são feitas por "
"ganchos que estão armazenados em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib/dhcpcd/dhcpcd-hooks</filename>. Você consegue "
"mudar esse comportamento removendo ou adicionando ganchos de/para esse "
"diretório. A execução de ganchos pode ser desabilitada usando-se a opção de "
"linha de comando <option>--nohook</option> (<option>-C</option>) ou pela "
"opção <option>nohook</option> no arquivo "
"<filename>/etc/dhcpcd.conf</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:396
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Make sure that you disable the <command>systemd-networkd</command> service "
"or configure it not to manage the interfaces you want to manage with "
"<application>dhcpcd</application>."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de desabilitar o serviço &quot;<command>systemd-"
"networkd</command>&quot; ou configurá-lo para não gerenciar as interfaces "
"que você quer gerenciar com o &quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:403
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"At this point you can test if <command>dhcpcd</command> is behaving as "
"expected by running the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Neste ponto você consegue testar se o <command>dhcpcd</command> está se "
"comportando conforme esperado executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:408
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl start "
"dhcpcd@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl start "
"dhcpcd@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:411
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start <command>dhcpcd</command> on a specific interface at boot, enable "
"the previously installed systemd unit by running the following command as "
"the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o <command>dhcpcd</command> em uma interface específica na "
"inicialização, habilite a unidade do systemd instalada anteriormente "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:416
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable "
"dhcpcd@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable "
"dhcpcd@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:419
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <replaceable>eth0</replaceable> with the actual interface name."
msgstr ""
"Substitua &quot;<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>&quot; pelo nome real da "
"interface."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:423
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>dhcpcd</command> service has options or lack thereof that might"
" be unsatisfactory. You can override them by running the following commands "
"as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"O serviço <command>dhcpcd</command> tem opções, ou carece delas, que podem "
"ser insatisfatórias. Você consegue substituí-las executando os seguintes "
"comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:428
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /etc/systemd/system/dhcpcd\\@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>.service.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/systemd/system/dhcpcd\\@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>.service.d/99-user.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Service]\n"
"ExecStart=\n"
"ExecStart=/sbin/dhcpcd -q -w <replaceable>&lt;list of parameters&gt;</replaceable> %I\n"
"ExecStop=\n"
"ExecStop=/sbin/dhcpcd -x <replaceable>&lt;list of parameters&gt;</replaceable> %I\n"
"</literal>EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /etc/systemd/system/dhcpcd\\@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>.service.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/systemd/system/dhcpcd\\@<replaceable>eth0</replaceable>.service.d/99-user.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Service]\n"
"ExecStart=\n"
"ExecStart=/sbin/dhcpcd -q -w <replaceable>&lt;list of parameters&gt;</replaceable> %I\n"
"ExecStop=\n"
"ExecStop=/sbin/dhcpcd -x <replaceable>&lt;list of parameters&gt;</replaceable> %I\n"
"</literal>EOF</userinput>"

